From 789d8f50800e58cf5cabfbe96cb627107ca3dd10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:10:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: fleet-run fixes - reclaim spot, range bands, grind
 phase, equip (F-219, I-394)

- revive: park the ghost up to 28 yd from the body, away from live hostiles
  and spawn points, before reclaiming (module reclaims within 34 yd)
- abilities carry min/max range from SpellRange: no ranged shots in melee
  (TOO_CLOSE), no melee strikes from range
- combat: our own cast bar no longer counts toward "no damage" (paladin
  walked out of fights while healing)
- equip cancels Auto Shot first (EQUIP_ERR_CANT_DO_RIGHT_NOW 39)
- I-394: walk_to_grind only takes in-phase spawns, never the spot we stand on,
  never one tried in the last 5 min; training dummies are not grind targets
- quest item use re-closes on a wandering target, retries OUT_OF_RANGE once
- a death in a defend loop stops it (no extra "fight 0: we died" lines)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
